ASM_Cloud Server v0.8.0 ? Placeholder EXE

This is a placeholder for the standalone Server EXE (Node 20 + native argon2/sqlite3).
Real EXE is built via GitHub Actions on tag v* (see .github/workflows/release.yml).

To run server without EXE, use Docker prod:
  docker compose -f docker-compose.yml -f docker-compose.prod.yml up --build -d

See docs/INSTALL_GUIDE.pdf for full guide.

